RV32I Single-Cycle CPU

This file documents the development of the RV32I single-cycle processor using Logisim-evolution.

Current Progress:
- 4-bit Register: Completed
- 32-bit Register: Completed
- 5-to-32 Decoder: Completed
- Register File: Completed
- ALU: Not started
- Control Unit: Not started
- Program Counter: Not started
- Instruction Memory: Not started
- Data Memory: Not started
- Complete Single-Cycle CPU: Not started

Tools:
- Logisim-evolution
- RV32I RISC-V ISA

Architecture:
The processor is being developed component-by-component, starting with the register subsystem. The completed single-cycle CPU will later serve as the foundation for a pipelined RISC-V processor.
